file tools/mycelium_muster_knot_witness.rish r3 witness — GREEN, proves verdict continuity (lapse · honor) · outsider/thin refusal across the cut · corrupt Knot never continued
recommend keep-going Muster r4 (true to the bytes — a real on-disk Cord fixture, a real Chorus judged against a real roll, the enrolled-voice count cross-checked against an independent awk reading), then the arc closes and a remember fold onto REMEMBER follows. A served muster · breach renames (cairn-first) · deep debride · seed force-push stay the maintainer's hand.
